.KEY tag/A,secs/A,args/F
.BRA {
.KET }
; RunZodCensus -- RunZod against RadeonGL's census minigl.library (it draws
; nothing and counts what the game asks for). The library comes from
; DEV:Libs/Census (copied there from RadeonGL's dist/Libs/Census by hand),
; added to LIBS: for this run only. Its CSVs go to DEV:Test/zod-census-{tag}
; (.csv per frame, -slots.csv per dispatch slot); the game's log to
; DEV:Test/zod-{tag}.log; a done marker follows when the run is over.
FailAt 1000
Stack 262144
CD DEV:Zod
Delete >NIL: DEV:Test/zod-census-{tag}#?
SetEnv MiniGLCensus DEV:Test/zod-census-{tag}
Assign LIBS: DEV:Libs/Census ADD
Version LIBS:minigl.library FULL >DEV:Test/zod-{tag}.log
DEV:Zod/zod_040 -t null -b red -b blue -e psettings_nopause.txt -r 640x480 -s -u -G zod -F on -B {secs} {args} >>DEV:Test/zod-{tag}.log
Echo "zod rc=$RC" >>DEV:Test/zod-{tag}.log
Assign LIBS: DEV:Libs/Census REMOVE
UnSetEnv MiniGLCensus
List DEV:Test/zod-census-{tag}#? >>DEV:Test/zod-{tag}.log
Echo >DEV:Test/zod-{tag}.done done
